{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "20260916-v3-stage-cp01-p0-baseline",
  "title": "V3 stage-oriented refactor CP01 \u2014 P0 baseline freeze and classification",
  "goal": "Freeze the pre-refactor facts of the guard system (file classification, call graph and initial TCB, .NET gates, drift, V3/V3_ifx divergence, ruleset, build inheritance, change frequency, trust contracts) and archive the baseline CI evidence before artifact expiry, without changing guard behavior.",
  "acceptanceCriteria": [
    "Every baseline file under V3, V3_backup, V3_ifx, docs/guards/plans, mcp/LayerGuard and .github has exactly one kind, stage and disposition, and the generator fails on any unclassified file.",
    "Every executable on a CI verdict chain belongs to exactly one TCB component, and each component records a base-owned validation suite and parity contract.",
    "The generated baseline records reproduce byte-for-byte with New-RefactorBaseline.ps1 -Check.",
    "Baseline CI evidence from run 35055279816 is archived with artifact and committed SHA-256 values, and all 13 required checks are recorded as success.",
    "Plan 06 P0.1-P0.10 are checked with evidence pointers, and no guard script, template, profile, policy, workflow, ruleset, required check or directory layout changes."
  ],
